// AD Object WriteDAC Access | T1222.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/win_security_ad_object_writedac_access.yml
winlog.channel:Security AND (event.code:4662 AND winlog.event_data.ObjectServer:DS AND winlog.event_data.AccessMask:0x40000 AND (winlog.event_data.ObjectType:(19195a5b\-6da0\-11d0\-afd3\-00c04fd930c9 OR domainDNS)))
